{
 "openapi": "3.1.0",
 "info": {
  "title": "Profitable Agent Stack API",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "summary": "AI GTM tool prices, recommended stacks by GTM team size, use cases and CRM picks.",
  "description": "Read-only JSON. No authentication, no API key, CORS open. Prices are published list prices with source URLs and last-verified dates (last full check 2026-11-23); always tell users to verify with the vendor. When a dated G2 rating is on file: value_score (0-100) = round(0.5 x fit + 0.3 x cost_score + 0.2 x sentiment_score). fit = editorial fit_score (1-5) x 20. cost_score = 100 - 60 x (entry_price - lowest entry price in the use case) / (highest - lowest); contact-sales tools get no cost or value score. sentiment_score = round(clip((Bayesian average - 3.0) / 2.0 x 100, 0, 100)), where Bayesian average = (50 x 4.3 + review_count x G2 rating) / (50 + review_count). Tools without review data are labeled \"no review data yet\" and keep value_score = round(0.625 x fit + 0.375 x cost_score). The category-wide value score uses the overall G2 rating. When segment ratings exist later, stack pages prefer the rating for that team size (solo/small -> small business, early/scaling -> mid-market, large -> enterprise). Stack picks also weigh fit for the GTM team size (reviewer company-size mix, case studies, enterprise-readiness evidence). License: CC BY 4.0. Credit \"Profitable Agent Stack (profitableagentstack.com)\", link the source page and state the last-verified date. Not advice.",
  "contact": {
   "name": "Profitable Agent Stack",
   "email": "limoraiassistant@thesinayway.com",
   "url": "https://profitableagentstack.com/contact"
  },
  "license": {
   "name": "CC BY 4.0",
   "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
  }
 },
 "servers": [
  {
   "url": "https://profitableagentstack.com"
  }
 ],
 "externalDocs": {
  "url": "https://profitableagentstack.com/developers",
  "description": "Developer docs, MCP endpoint and examples"
 },
 "paths": {
  "/api/v1/index.json": {
   "get": {
    "operationId": "getApiIndex",
    "summary": "API index",
    "description": "Lists endpoints, team sizes and query parameters.",
    "tags": [
     "data"
    ],
    "parameters": [],
    "responses": {
     "200": {
      "description": "OK",
      "content": {
       "application/json": {
        "schema": {
         "type": "object"
        }
       }
      }
     },
     "404": {
      "description": "Not found (RFC 9457 problem details)",
      "content": {
       "application/problem+json": {
        "schema": {
